### Phase M — Auto Net-Profit from ledger (توزيع تلقائي)
- New `ComputeNetProfitUseCase` (`net_profit.rs`): reads posted entries (status=Posted) up to the migration's cutover day end-of-day via `list_with_filters`, then classifies each line by `AccountType` (Revenue: credit−debit; Expenses: debit−credit); returns `ComputedNetProfitDto{net_profit, total_revenue, total_expenses, gross_profit, entry_count}`. Pure `compute_ledger_totals` free function + 4 unit tests (revenue/exp separation, drafts excluded, reversal nets to zero, unknown-account skipped).
- Tauri `compute_opening_balance_net_profit` registered; frontend `openingBalanceService.computeNetProfit` + "احسب من اليومية" button on the allocate card (pre-fills net_profit + shows revenue/expense/net summary with entry count). Manual override still supported.

