- **N2**: `OpeningBalanceMigration::reopen()` (Cancelled→Draft, clears validate/approve/post/lock audit) + `ReopenOpeningBalanceUseCase` + Tauri `reopen_opening_balance_migration` + a "إعادة فتح" button on cancelled migrations. +2 domain tests (reopen resets audit; rejects posted/draft).
- Tests updated for canonical labels: domain `cash_receipt`, infra `draft_entry_has_no_reversal_metadata` expects `general_journal`.
