- FOUND + FIXED latent bug: migration 130 added depreciation_method to fixed_assets, but migration 004 already ships that column -> "duplicate column name" on FRESH installs. The pool's healing loop then marked 130..141 as applied WITHOUT running them, silently dropping the opening-balance tables (139/140) and journal reversal columns (141) on new DBs. Migration 130 is now a no-op (column already exists via 004); fresh installs now apply every migration.

