- JournalEntryRepository::save_reversal_pair persists the reversal + its Reversed original in ONE transaction; ReverseJournalEntryUseCase now uses it (true cross-row atomicity).
- Migration 142_reversal_integrity_cleanup.sql (idempotent): deletes Reversal entries with id a dangling reversing_of_entry_id (or NULL link) and resets stranded 'Reversed' originals back to Posted.
